9. Interest and Fees
SECTION TEXT:

9. Interest and Fees

A. Interest

- The Borrower shall pay interest on the outstanding principal balance of the loan at the rate of ten percent (10%) per annum, compounded quarterly.

B. Late Payment Fees

- If the Borrower fails to make any payment when due, the Borrower shall pay a late payment fee equal to five percent (5%) of the amount of the overdue payment.

C. Other Fees

- The Borrower shall pay all reasonable fees, costs, and expenses incurred by the Lender in connection with this Agreement, including, but not limited to, attorney's fees, appraisal fees, and document preparation fees.

D. Prepayment

- The Borrower shall have the right to prepay the loan in full at any time without penalty, except for any unpaid interest accrued up to the date of prepayment.

10. Default and Remedies
A. Default

- If the Borrower fails to make any payment when due, or breaches any other term or condition of this Agreement, such failure or breach shall constitute an event of default.

B. Acceleration

- Upon the occurrence of an event of default, the Lender may declare all amounts then outstanding under this Agreement immediately due and payable.

C. Remedies

- In the event of a default, the Lender shall have the right to take any and all actions permitted by law, including, but not limited to, foreclosure on the security, filing a lawsuit for damages, and seeking injunctive relief.

D. Attorney's Fees

- In the event of a default, the Borrower shall pay all reasonable attorney's fees, costs, and expenses incurred by the Lender in connection with any action taken to enforce this Agreement or collect amounts due under this Agreement.

E. Waiver of Rights

- The failure of the Lender to exercise any right or remedy under this Agreement shall not constitute a waiver of such right or remedy, nor shall it preclude the Lender from exercising such right or remedy at any subsequent time.

F. No Waiver of Default

- The Lender's acceptance of any payment after a default shall not constitute a waiver of the default or any other default that may exist under this Agreement.

G. No Extensions

- Any extension of time granted by the Lender to the Borrower shall not constitute a waiver of any right or remedy of the Lender under this Agreement.

H. No Setoff

- The Borrower shall not have the right to set off any amounts owed by the Lender to the Borrower against any amounts owed by the Borrower to the Lender under this Agreement.

